{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Thrones\u00a0</strong>is an arena shooter roguelike where slimes are determined to conquer every dungeon in the world. Tired of being the weakest creatures in the dungeons, the slimes have learned to wield all the weapons at their disposal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to adapt! sometimes you won\u2019t be able to build exactly what you had in mind, but the good news is there\u2019s always the chance to create a new build that can be just as powerful as the one you originally envisioned. With infinite possibilities, every run brings fresh opportunities to experiment and dominate!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585540?t=1746477494","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585540?t=1746477494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585540/8aef58236de53a838c0ec1ddc97447dd24b7c5cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746477494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585540/8aef58236de53a838c0ec1ddc97447dd24b7c5cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746477494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Thrones\u00a0</strong>is an arena shooter roguelike where slimes are determined to conquer every dungeon in the world. Tired of being the weakest creatures in the dungeons, the slimes have learned to wield all the weapons at their disposal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to adapt! sometimes you won\u2019t be able to build exactly what you ha